{
  "bookId": "hero-212207",
  "id": "bond-35312",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "35312001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "如果我没认错的话，这是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35312002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "白骨教堂。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35312003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "原型是那个没错，我想了很久要送给塞西尔什么样子的屋子。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35312004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "但是看到这个教堂的一瞬间，就觉得很适合塞西尔。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35312005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "它确实出乎我的意料，是生与死完美的结合。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35312006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "这让我想到我的先祖也曾参与设计过一座这样的教堂。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35312007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "那么我们的婚礼就在这里举办。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "35312009",
              "text": "婚婚婚婚……礼？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "35312008",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35312009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "在先辈和无数逝去之人的见证下，你愿意与我共同面对贫穷、灾厄与苦难吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35312010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "回答我。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "35312012",
              "text": "我……愿意……"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "35312011",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35312012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "大点声。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "35312014",
              "text": "我愿意！"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "35312013",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35312014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "很好，我也愿意。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
